                            "title": "Tables have different content in the summary attribute and `<caption>`.",
                            "description": "The summary attribute should describe the table structure, while `<caption>` should have the onscreen title. Accurate table mark-up helps users of screen readers. [Learn more about summary and caption](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.13/table-duplicate-name).",
